  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">DBP Resonans AS and MKU ICB</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Danish company Resonans A/S and the Kenyan Institute of Capacity Building (ICB), Mount Kenya University have identified a gap in the market place for executive education programmes. The partnership wishes to offer educational programmes at executive levels that are not presently available in Kenya. The project will facilitate knowhow and technology transfer from the Danish partners to the local Kenyan partner. The partnership aims at creating a sustainable business out of building capacities with direct impact on value addition, job-creation through economic growth, and increased CSR awareness.</narrative>
  </description>
